          "_name": "slider02",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"slider2 mbr-embla\" group=\"Slider\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"embla\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" inline>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" title=\"Padding Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" inline>\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<header>Carousel</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"autoplay\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" title=\"Interval\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"1\" step=\"1\" condition=\"autoplay\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Loop\" name=\"loop\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Draggable\" name=\"draggable\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrows\" title=\"Arrows\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"arrowsMobile\" title=\"Mobile Arrows\" condition=\"arrows\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Slides</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" name=\"gap\" title=\"Gap\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Name\" name=\"showName\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author Title\" name=\"showDesk\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"position-relative text-center\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"mb-5 mbr-fonts-style mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t<b>What Our Fantastic Users Say</b>\n\t\t</h3>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"embla\" data-loop=\"{{loop}}\" data-auto-play=\"{{autoplay}}\" data-auto-play-interval=\"{{interval}}\" data-draggable=\"{{draggable}}\" data-skip-snaps=\"true\" data-align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__viewport\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item active\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user_image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/e5afb9e7a7b02-1600x636.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">The circular ceiling and identical flanking posters create a perfectly balanced corporate environment.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCynthia Diaz\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfluencer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user_image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/small-0kkjvusf-500x208.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">The interior car dashboard and sun visors form a symmetrical frame around the external scene.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSharon Davis\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfluencer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user_image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/small-9orml2ay-967x403.jpeg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"8\" data-bs-slide-to=\"8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user_text mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">The centered branding and subjects facing each other create a staged, formal balance.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAshley Brown\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfluencer\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<button class=\"embla__button embla__button--prev\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t<button class=\"embla__button embla__button--next\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "slider02-i",
          "_cid": "vghn9yBonI",
